<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6b04005d20c4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "She started searching social media and uncovered dozens of chat groups on the messaging app Telegram where users were sharing photos of women they knew and using AI software to convert them into fake pornographic images within seconds." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6de6efa4f572> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3837] A lot of the blame is rightly being placed on Telegram, especially as the scandal is coming to a head at the same time as the platform’s Chief Executive Officer Pavel Durov has been arrested and charged in France." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3837" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6dea2b74b5d8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3820] ... share them on Telegram." ;
