<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7abbac9be414> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The deepfakes usually combine a victim's face with a body in a sexually explicit pose, taken from pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/80aba309d7bd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The spate of chat groups, linked to individual schools and universities across the country, were discovered on the social media app Telegram over the past week." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/873c040cb350> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "South Korea Is Facing Deepfake Porn Crisis" ;
