<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9335a994d7c8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "但一开始，Deepfake的背后、一项名为\"生成对抗网络（GAN）\"的技术，还几近人畜无害。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9e20fe9133f8> a airo:Evidence ;
