    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a49220b007d8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Telegram channel with more than 220,000 participants was reportedly being used to create and share these artificial intelligence-generated pornographic images." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3837" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bb180e330d47> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "看到韩国Deepfake事件后，鹿影科技联创李倩愤怒透顶，当即拉着创始人头脑风暴到深夜，口干舌燥之余，二人都很沮丧。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c0e50e519d99> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2014年诞生在谷歌大脑实验室的GAN，有着难以普及的一切要素：软件安装难度大、操作的技术门槛高，同时还需要昂贵的训练数据集和算力资源。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

