<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4475270d973a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Under the law enacted in 2020, people convicted of making sexually explicit or abusive deepfakes with an intent to distribute them can be sent to prison for up to five years." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/59ce10d70f02> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3820] The issue of sexual deepfakes rose to the spotlight when a graduate of Seoul National University in his 40s allegedly conspired with three other men to create sexually explicit images and videos of victims using deepfake technology, and share them on Telegram." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3820" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/77c131399ad8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3821] Before this latest crisis exploded, South Korea's Advocacy Centre for Online Sexual Abuse victims (ACOSAV) was already noticing a sharp uptick in the number of underage victims of deepfake pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/aafc43950a69> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2023年12月，在中国台湾省，曾有一起判例，给了Deepfake受害女性些许希望。网名为\"小玉\"的男网红朱玉宸，使用Deepfake技术，将100多位知名女性合成A片，上网贩卖获利超过1300万台币（约288万元）。最终，他以违反《个人资料保护法》等罪名被起诉，并被判处5年有期徒刑。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d8a67c3c7642> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3837] South Korea has been rocked by a wave of sexually explicit deepfake images being created and shared online." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3837" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fdad64941847> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2022年11月，中国出台了第一条明确针对Deepfake提出的规定：《互联网信息服务深度合成管理规定》。这一规定对Deepfake内容制作者、技术服务提供商，以及制作、传播发布行为，都做出了规制。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/73d9105ebd54> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Deepfakes are generated using artificial intelligence, and often combine the face of a real person with a fake body." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00aa50203f34> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "More than half of deepfakes globally target South Koreans, and the majority of those deepfakes victimize singers and actresses from the country, according to [\"2023 State of Deepfakes,\"] a study published by the U.S.-based cybersecurity firm Security Hero." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/086254efc899> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"For teenagers, deepfakes have become part of their culture, they're seen as a game or a prank,\" said the counsellor, who runs the Aha Seoul Youth Cultural Centre." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0a3e3ea00df8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "在推特上，智英与韩国男性不停周旋。她的推特账号早已实时被男性们监控，刚上传的、呼吁大家举报的厌女内容网址，下一分钟网址就被修改了。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/106b8745d118> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "根据网络安全监测机构SecurityHero的统计，2023年韩国的Deepfake色性产业，就占到了全球的53%------与之相对的，韩国2023年的GDP，还不到全球的2%。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/12f1412f8990> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Park Jihyun, who, as a young student journalist, uncovered the Nth room sex-ring back in 2019, has since become a political advocate for victims of digital sex crimes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/18da1d1e68ab> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Leading K-pop agencies have declared war on deepfakes, saying they were collecting evidence and threatening lawsuits against their creators and distributors." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1b77204282d6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "在论坛Discord上，DeepNude的安装包以20美元的价格出售。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2b305bd3c8c0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Telegram has been actively removing content reported from Korea that breached its terms of service and will continue to do so." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3819" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2d707a669e66> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The number of deepfakes targeting teachers has surged in the past couple of years, according to the Ministry of Education." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3a02d4f1ac90> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The South Korean police reported 297 cases of deepfake sex crime between January and July, compared with 156 for all of 2021, when such data was first collected." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3e034ec813e7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It comes days after South Korean police said they had launched an investigation into Telegram, accusing it of \"abetting\" the distribution of such images." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/41f5f1ab0d7d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In April, she learned from the police that two of her former classmates at Seoul National University were among those who had been detained." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4d39d619d4ea> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "1 of the centre's leaders, Park Seonghye, said over the past week her staff had been inundated with calls and were working around the clock." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/588bd708abf2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The government has since announced a series of measures, including toughening punishment for deepfake sex crimes, pushing to secure a hotline with Telegram for year-round consultations and punishing people for simply possessing deepfake pornographic materials." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3820" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/597feb9ca371> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The National Police Agency also announced a seven-month intensive crackdown on deepfake sex crimes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3820" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6599f96d036b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Chung Jin-kwon, who was a middle-school principal before assuming a role at the Seoul Metropolitan Office of Education last month, said his former school had discussed whether to omit student photos from yearbooks." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/78be5b6ca4d4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Lee Myung-hwa, who treats young sex offenders, agreed that although the outbreak of deepfake abuse might seem sudden, it had long been lurking under the surface." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/78df0f78ba56> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "South Korean President Yoon Suk Yeol on Tuesday instructed authorities to \"thoroughly investigate and address these digital sex crimes to eradicate them\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7a5c272f385d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"You find a chat room on a holiday, but by the time you get court approval, it's gone,\" said Hahm Young-ok, a senior investigator of online crimes at the National Police Agency." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/84e4757067cb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2023年的苏州大学黄谣和AI换脸事件中，受害者就潜入传播AI伪造图像的聊天房，进行取证，并利用排除法，将不同标记的照片在朋友圈中分组发布，进行逐个排除，最终将加害者抓获。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/862a41bc8d6a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a statement to South Korea's Communications Standards Commission (KCSC), Telegram said the situation was \"unfortunate\", adding that it \"apologised if there had been an element of misunderstanding\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/864a15105f3f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ms Ko's report in the Hankyoreh newspaper has shocked South Korea." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/88573f540c75> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "最早监测到这款Bot的网络安全公司Sensity发现，上线不到一年，这款Bot已经产生了68万多名女性的虚假裸照，约104852张女性照片被公开发布在这款应用上。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97f8d2b90ddf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In 2020, as the South Korean authorities were pursuing a blackmail ring that forced young women to make sexually explicit videos for paying viewers, they found something else floating through the dark recesses of social media: pornographic images with other people's faces crudely attached." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9eb34f88037b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Last Tuesday, South Korean President Yoon Suk Yeol had instructed authorities to \"thoroughly investigate and address these digital sex crimes to eradicate them\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ab34f1670bd0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Some of the Telegram channels, called \"rape and humiliation rooms,\" targeted individuals or women from certain schools, said Park Seong-hye, a team leader at the government-funded Women's Human Rights Institute of Korea, who has investigated digital sex crimes and provided help to victims." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ac564ab55017> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "此后，事件的走向，和如今的韩国\"N号房2.0\"十分类似。Bot的使用者，自发在Telegram上建立了社群，超过10万名成员，成了\"N号房\"的初代居民。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bbcaad7750b0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Korean Teachers Union, meanwhile, believes more than 200 schools have been affected in this latest string of incidents." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/dabd3a268500> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "South Korean President Yoon Suk Yeol called on his government to crack down on the digital abuse." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3837" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/db3544bf442e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"It's time to choose between protecting the platforms and protecting our children and adolescents,\" said Lee Soo-jung, a professor of forensic psychology at Kyonggi University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ee8561d5eca5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In 2020, Cho Joo-bin, the mastermind of a digital sex crime ring, was sentenced to 40 years in prison on charges of luring young women, including teenagers, into making videos that he sold online through encrypted chat rooms on Telegram." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3819" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f2bc4f05a5cb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2 days earlier, South Korean journalist Ko Narin had published what would turn into the biggest scoop of her career." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f4fef22cb7e9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Most of the people involved in the production and spread of the imagery --- as well as many of the victims --- are in their teens, according to data compiled by the Korean National Police Agency." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3819" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3cc93b67011c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This is a direct criticism of the country's President Yoon Suk Yeol, who has denied the existence of structural sexism, cut funding to victim support groups and is abolishing the government's gender equality ministry." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/83a91f05bc7d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2024年9月4日，中科院的女工程师张欣怡，将自己团队研发的Deepfake对抗模型，向全球开源。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c99f08462c7c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A lot of the blame is rightly being placed on Telegram, especially as the scandal is coming to a head at the same time as the platform’s Chief Executive Officer Pavel Durov has been arrested and charged in France." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3837" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/26950937eb63> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Telegram has apologised to South Korean authorities for its handling of deepfake pornographic material shared via its messaging app, amid a digital sex crime epidemic in the country." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4d4306a9c518> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The issue of sexual deepfakes rose to the spotlight when a graduate of Seoul National University in his 40s allegedly conspired with three other men to create sexually explicit images and videos of victims using deepfake technology, and share them on Telegram." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3820" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d83d92346d6e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In the end, the National Assembly enacted a vaguely worded law against those making and distributing it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3872" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c34cb9a6a82d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Before this latest crisis exploded, South Korea's Advocacy Centre for Online Sexual Abuse victims (ACOSAV) was already noticing a sharp uptick in the number of underage victims of deepfake pornography." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AIModel/fb17de80b4d3> a airo:AIModel ;
    rdfs:label "Deepfake Detection Model" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "0.9"^^xsd:float ;
    airo:extractionMode "explicit" ;
    airo:hasDescription "Deepfake对抗模型" ;
    airo:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/83a91f05bc7d> ;
    airo:hasSourceDocument <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/document/3838> .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3361653fe89d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "These discoveries in South Korea follow the arrest of the Russian-born founder of Telegram, Pavel Durov, in France, on allegations that child pornography, drug trafficking and fraud were taking place on the messaging app." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7133" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3c9b45d959b4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Park Ji-hyun, a women's rights activist and former interim leader of the main opposition Democratic Party, said the government needed to declare a \"national emergency\" in response to South Korea's deepfake porn problem." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/affd28b94f5c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The investigation in South Korea followed the arrest of Pavel Durov, Telegram's Russian-born founder, by the French authorities last month." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3819" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ba9af0b2c5e4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "2019年，多伦多大学公民实验室曾发表了一项研究，试图探索微信如何自动审查巨量聊天中的图片。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3838" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fb857fb6560b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Bae Bok-joo, a women's rights activist and a former member of the minor Justice Party, told the AFP news agency." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3822" .

